we are going to join Steam Next Fest with our demo and that will hopefully be the biggest push we are going to do before we release our game on December 1st 2026! But we are not just waiting for that to happen, meanwhile we are working so hard on completing the latest features for the full game. Feedbacks from the Demo We've already made lots of improvements, fixes and new f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T17:23:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1846018067945030","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Roll for Order x Painted Wastelands - Backerkit campaign now live!","summary":"🎲 The Painted Wastelands campaign is now LIVE!You may already have spotted a little piece of The Painted Wastelands in Roll for Order!As anticipated as part of our collaboration with Agamemnon Press, the Dreamstuff dice set, based on a real set of dice you can actually own, is already hidden in the current Roll for Order demo alongside a special Painted Wastelands poster.If you'd like to check out the world behind the collaboration, The Painted Wastelands 5.5e campaign is now live on BackerKit!h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:26:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1846018067941086","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO OUT NOW!","summary":"Hi dice goblins! Today I'm so excited to announce that the official demo of Roll for Order: Sort Every set is now AVAILABLE! You'll get to sort 328 dice, 41 sets of dice of 5 different categories! You'll be able to pick from 5 classes: Squire: No active abilities, passive increased movement speed and increased backpack capacity. The perfect class for those that don't want to sort relying on active abilities.Warrior: A strong and reliable dice carrier. You'll get abilities to increase your backpa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:14:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941086","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1846018067924580","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo postponed to October 12th!","summary":"Hi dice goblins, I have a bad news and a good news today. The bad news is that the demo has been postponed to October 12th! The good news is that our demo is in a very good shape. This extra time is giving us the chance to fix some bugs that were there since the beginning such as one that was making walls and floors glitching and disappear on some specific machine configuration, mostly on laptop with integrated GPU. We have now put a potential fix that should remove this issue. On top of that we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T23:44:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1844751498232071","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"New collaboration announcement: Frost Earth Studio x The Painted Wastelands","summary":"Frost Earth Studio x The Painted Wastelands Greetings, Lost Dreamers! We’re excited to announce that Roll for Order: Sort Every Set! is teaming up with Agamemnon Press to bring the strange dreamworld of The Painted Wastelands into Roll for Order.The Painted Wastelands is an ENNIE Award-winning psychedelic fantasy setting created by Agamemnon Press and brought to life through the incredible artwork of deranged artist Tim Molloy. It is a world of bizarre landscapes, strange creatures, dangerous dr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T17:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1844751498217028","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo coming on October 8th!","summary":"Hi dice goblins! Today I'm so excited to announce that the official demo for Roll for order is coming on October 8th 2026! As said in our previous devblog the demo will introduce new mechanics such as golden keys to unlock dice cabinets, audio cassettes you can find to unlock new music and 'the squire' a new powerless class but with a bigger inventory. That plus lot of bug fixes, quality of life improvements and many new exposed settings to make sure you can customize your experience as you like","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T00:57:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1843481262693956","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest results and Demo - Looking ahead","summary":"Hello dice goblins! We're more than a week into our playtest and the results have been incredible. We had hundreds of players playing Roll for Order for the first time and we're thrilled to announce that the feedbacks we have been receveing are incredibly good! THE PLAYTEST Almost 200 people completed our feedback form and more than 85% of players have voted 4⭐/5 and 5⭐/5, with the remaining of votes being mostly 3 out of 5. Our average score currently is 4.15/5.0! ⭐⭐⭐⭐But this is far from meani","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T03:07:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1842846814441881","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest NOW AVAILABLE!","summary":"Hello dice goblins! The time has finally come! The first playtest of Roll for Order is now LIVE! To get access to it you just need to click on the green button 'Join the Playtest' and you will have automatic access to it. Because this is a playtest there are still some rough edges here and there. The 'How To Play' section is not completed yet, there may be some spelling errors and most importantly we're still balancing and improving the abilities as well as improving the feedbacks of some abilit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T01:13:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1842212951307860","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"update","title":"We just reached 10.000 wishlists + Playtest update!","summary":"Hello dice rollers 🎲! I'm here with good news and bad news. The good news is that we just reached more than 10.000 wishlists and me and the whole team are so grateful for this achievement. We're pouring hundreds of hours of work and a lot of love for sorting games and dice so seeing so many people are interested about Roll for Order makes us very proud and happy, thank you once again for this incredible milestone from the bottom of our hearts!The bad news is that while we do have a playtest buil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T16:00:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307860","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1842212951298695","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest INCOMING!","summary":"Hello dice rollers and dice goblins!I'm incredibly excited to announce that we're very close to our first Roll for Order playtest! This playtest will include a small room of the basement with 4 full categories of dice: Ocean, Fire, Neon and Egypt. You'll find 380 themed dice scattered across the room, waiting to be collected and sorted. Every single die has been carefully crafted to feel unique, satisfying, and exciting to discover. You'll be able to pick them up, inspect them, rotate them, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T02:40:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298695","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1841579228671795","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"A first look at some of our custom-made dice sets!","summary":"Hello dice rollers! We're here today with some exciting updates! Today I'd like to show you our first two dice category: Egypt and Neon! One of our goal with Roll for Orders was to make sure that every dice lovers get what they expect. So you are not going to find generic dice here, and even more important you are not going to find dice made with AI or anything of the sort. We're making every single dice by hand with custom color patterns, design, reflections and more depending on the set and ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T16:47:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671795","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1840944183784911","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Roll for Order just reached 5000+ wishlists! Thank you 🥳","summary":"Hi people! We would never thought to reach this milestone in such a short amount of time. I'm so happy to announce that Roll for Order has surpassed 5000 wishlists in just 4 days🥳! We're working hard to release our first playtest soon followed by our demo! More announcements on that in the coming weeks. If you want to support us make sure to share our game around, thank you so much once again. Andrea Frost Luna Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T01:03:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5061290-1840944183781020","game_id":"steam-5061290","kind":"announcement","title":"Roll for Order just reached 1000+ wishlists! Thank you 🥳","summary":"We are so incredibly excited to announce that Roll for Order: Sort Every Set! has just surpassed 1000 wishlists in its first 24h after its initial announcement on Steam! We still can't believe it. We are hard at work to keep pushing toward the end line of development, making sure everything is as optimized, polished and satisfying as it can possible be! More updates will come soon as we'll share more on the abilities of our classes and how they change the way you play the game! If you want to su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T23:40:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steams